# UI minimum-size capture: smallest allowed window with footer stats constrained inside the frame.
seed 4242
physics off
text off
vsync off
water_hidden on
terrain_hidden on
frames 24
ui tab profile
ui rect 64 70 430 250
ui blur on
ui renderer_combo closed
ui profiler_expand none
ui_test_pattern off
screenshot Profile/ui_min_size.bmp frame 20

camera main 500 60 650  600 33 600  0 1 0
